---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="URI Industrial & Systems Engineering">
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-content">
            <p class="tagline">Algorithm to Action</p>
            <h1>URI Industrial &amp; Systems Engineering</h1>
            <p>
                The URI ISE Group develops optimization algorithms, machine-learning models, digital-twin
                simulations, and data-driven pipelines that advance manufacturing, logistics, and industrial
                systems for academic, industry, and public-sector partners.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="button primary" href="/research">Explore Research</a>
                <a class="button secondary" href="/contact">Partner With Us</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-compact">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Mission</h2>
                <p>
                    Applying optimization, machine learning, and systems engineering to advance
                    manufacturing, logistics, and industrial infrastructure.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="split-figure">
                <div class="stack">
                    <figure class="site-figure">
                        <img src="/assets/photos/industry40bed-clean.jpg" alt="Top-down view of the Industry 4.0 testbed table with collaborative robot arms, conveyor modules, and camera monitors" loading="lazy" />
                        <figcaption>The Industry 4.0 testbed in the capstone room: collaborative arms, conveyor modules, and vision stations on a reconfigurable table.</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                    <div class="card-grid">
                        <article class="card">
                            <h3>Optimization &amp; Scheduling</h3>
                            <p>From production scheduling to supply-chain networks, we develop algorithms that improve throughput and reduce cost.</p>
                        </article>
                        <article class="card">
                            <h3>Machine Learning &amp; Data</h3>
                            <p>Genetic algorithms, computer vision, and predictive models for manufacturing process control and quality assurance.</p>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <figure class="site-figure">
                    <img src="/assets/photos/vr-demo-presentation.jpg" alt="A lab member wearing a VR headset demonstrates a simulation to visitors while a student presents beside a monitor" loading="lazy" />
                    <figcaption>Lab members demonstrate a VR walkthrough of the lab's digital-twin work to visiting guests.</figcaption>
                </figure>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-compact">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Research Areas</h2>
                <p>Six integrated threads spanning algorithms, hardware, and data infrastructure.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-grid card-grid-3x2">
                <article class="card icon-card">
                    <svg class="icon-card-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M7 7h.01"/><path d="M17 7h.01"/><path d="M7 17h.01"/><path d="M17 17h.01"/><path d="M12 2v20"/><path d="M2 12h20"/></svg>
                    <h3>Digital Twins</h3>
                    <p>High-fidelity simulation environments for testing, validation, and chaos engineering of industrial systems.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="card icon-card">
                    <svg class="icon-card-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m13.5 8.5-5 5"/><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
                    <h3>Smart Mfg &amp; CNC</h3>
                    <p>GCode interception, sensor-rich machining, and custom tooling fabrication on in-house equipment.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="card icon-card">
                    <svg class="icon-card-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"/></svg>
                    <h3>Optimization</h3>
                    <p>Production scheduling, multi-agent coordination, and genetic ML algorithms for process control.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="card icon-card">
                    <svg class="icon-card-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
                    <h3>Vision &amp; QC</h3>
                    <p>Computer vision for real-time defect detection, dimensional measurement, and robotic pick-and-place.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="card icon-card">
                    <svg class="icon-card-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="16" height="16" x="4" y="4" rx="2"/><rect width="6" height="6" x="9" y="9" rx="1"/><path d="M12 2v2"/><path d="M12 20v2"/><path d="M2 12h2"/><path d="M20 12h2"/></svg>
                    <h3>Data &amp; IIoT</h3>
                    <p>End-to-end sensor data pipelines, SCADA integration, and real-time operational dashboards.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="card icon-card">
                    <svg class="icon-card-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
                    <h3>Cyber-Physical</h3>
                    <p>Resilient edge architectures, testbed orchestration, and secure operation under degraded connectivity.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="section-cta">
                <a class="button secondary" href="/research">View All Research &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-compact">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Graduate Certificate in Industry 4.0</h2>
                <p>A 12-credit, fully online credential for working professionals.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-grid">
                <article class="card">
                    <h3>12 Credits · 4 Courses</h3>
                    <p>A focused, stackable credential covering IIoT, machine learning, MES, and special projects.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <h3>100% Online</h3>
                    <p>Complete the certificate entirely online — designed around the schedules of working professionals.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <h3>Career-Ready Skills</h3>
                    <p>Industry-aligned knowledge in smart manufacturing, data analytics, and cyber-physical systems.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="section-cta">
                <a class="button primary" href="/industry4-0#certificate">Learn More &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
